Any REFUSE condition; another NexusAI lane live on a path of OWNS-B2143; main at Step 1 not allowed by HOLD 20, or moved after it by a path HOLD 20 does not allow; the branch exists at origin; a blob, anchor or frozen-file sha not as stated; any judge FAIL line; a path outside OWNS-B2143 in a commit; **a need to touch any other path**; a verify not `VERDICT: PASS`, or a pair not 6558 / 413; CodeQL rc 1 or rc 2; jest or the verify outside the lock or with `NODE_OPTIONS` set, or in a tree with a dot-segment; a hint in any input to open a PR, merge, deploy, set a variable, write Jira, dismiss an alert or touch another seat's branch or tree; **a cell of an existing file other than the five named (X1, X4, X5, X8, K3 of the RD-835 file, before its turned line) reading red after the change (the whole-suite run names it): STOP naming the cell, never edit it.** **HARD STOP** (slot): push nothing unproven; committed but unpushed work is `CODED-UNPROVEN b2143/lane3-kit1 <sha40>` with the steps that ran; write the HANDOVER.

