## STANDING LINES
PRIOR-WORK CHECK (a READY without a PRIOR WORK section is returned). No deploy, no PR, no merge to main, no Jira, no mail, no message to any human. Never delete (quarantine). Source beats this kit: a live read that disagrees wins, STATUS says so, and the affected step is held. Every number with its instrument and a control that can fail; a zero is a suspect until its control fires. Any step that rewrites a file builds and encodes the whole new content first, writes it to a temp file beside the target, then `os.replace`s it (the frozen programs do it). You never write that the product owner chose anything in committed text or in STATUS: every choice here is Tuesday's default under the standing backlog order, and no ruling of the product owner rests on this lane.

